  "Military support to Russia: Ukrainian and South Korean intelligence, Open Source Centre, the Multilateral Sanctions Monitoring Team, INSS, leaked Alabuga contracts, Russian procurement prices": "Apoyo militar a Rusia: inteligencia ucraniana y surcoreana, Open Source Centre, el Multilateral Sanctions Monitoring Team, INSS, contratos filtrados de Alabuga, precios de adquisición rusos",
